1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,340
So here's something you can do before the sun goes down today

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,860
Call the friend who's gone too quiet for the things they didn't say

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:11,700
Help somebody move a couch, or give somebody a ride

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,540
Pay for the car behind you, then just smile and drive

5
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,140
You don't need a lot of money, and you don't need a plan

6
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,740
Just pick up when it rings, and be the one to lend a hand

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,580
'Cause the gold ain't in your pocket, and it ain't up on your shelf

8
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:30,900
The gold is every footprint that you leave on somebody else

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:36,980
So leave footprints of gold (footprints of gold)

10
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:42,500
In everyone you hold (everyone you hold)

11
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:48,260
So when they walk the road you walked, they'll know which way to go

12
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,420
Start it today (start it today)

13
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,020
Don't you wait (don't you wait)

14
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:55,780
Every little kindness leaves a step that glows

15
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,160
So leave footprints of gold (footprints of gold, footprints of gold)
